// INJS2065 v16.45: honeycomb WALL lattice on clamp face (reject v16.44 solid hex bosses/pockets).
// Clip mid == split_z mate plane. CLIP_Z=[12.45,24.05] equal ±5.8 A/B; CLIP_X=[-7.5,7.5] (15 mm). Land pockets ±7.46; POCKET_X=[-7.55,7.55].
// Honeycomb: pad 1.2 mm on clamp face → Y[9.2,10.4]; cut open hex cells (pointy-top rot 0°, vertical flats // Z).
// Land −Y openings: solid_extrude flip=true (match v16.44); +Y flip=false.
// Wall 1.2 mm (=3 FDM perimeters @0.4 nozzle; allow 0.8–1.6). Cell FF 2.8 (R_ap 1.4); land openings FF 3.0 (+0.2 CLR) depth 1.35.
// Grid: staggered 3×3 pointy-top (8 cells), S=FF+wall=4.0, row_pitch≈3.464; X∈{-4,0,4}/{-2,2}, Z∈{14.786,18.25,21.714}.
// Keep outer-edge open-C lip; no inner xbars. −Y clip = solid_mirror of +Y. Print: YZ on bed, build +X.
// SHELL_X=[-12.0, 28.0], SHELL_Y=[±12]; green-only Technic; no face holes at x=0 (bearing).
// Shared refs: CLIP_Z0/Z1 / CLIP_X0/X1; POCKET = CLIP ± CLR. Side faces: technic_side_yp/ym.
// REVIEW EXPLODE ONLY: +Y/−Y clip solid_move_copy ±14 mm before assembly components (not SoT).
